# Generated eval evidence - produced by a live agent or judge run. Never
# committed: it is machine- and session-specific, can be large, and may contain
# fetched third-party content.
#
# results/ is generated too. The DURABLE output of a measurement run is the
# conclusion, which belongs in README.md under "Measured baseline" where it gets
# read and reviewed. A committed per-case JSON dump goes stale silently the next
# time the description changes and then misinforms whoever finds it.
outputs/
results/
*.lint.json
*.junit.xml
